    },
    "page1_s3": {
      "section_id": "page1_s3",
      "section_title": "QUOTES ARE VALID FOR 30 DAYS ONLY!",
      "section_type": "prose",
      "raw_text": "This quote meets the definition of private flood insurance contained in 42 U.S.C. 4012a(b)(7) and the corresponding regulation.",
      "page_range": [
        1
      ],
      "form_number": null
    },
    "page1_s4": {
      "section_id": "page1_s4",
      "section_title": null,
      "section_type": "prose",
      "raw_text": "THIS IS A RENEWAL QUOTE AND DOES NOT IMPLY THAT COVERAGE IS BOUND OR IN FORCE FOR THIS DATE. COVERAGE WILL BE IN FORCE UPON THE RECEIPT OF PAYMENT IN FULL.",
      "page_range": [
        1
      ],
      "form_number": null
    },
    "page2_s1": {
      "section_id": "page2_s1",
      "section_title": "Conditions:",
      "section_type": "prose",
      "raw_text": "Flood Wording - Sterling Standard Flood Form 45 days Cancellation Clause",
      "page_range": [
        2
      ],
      "form_number": null
    },
    "page2_s2": {
      "section_id": "page2_s2",
      "section_title": null,
      "section_type": "prose",
      "raw_text": "TRIA Acceptance Endorsement, New & Renewal Business TRIA Not Purchased Clause",
      "page_range": [
        2
      ],
      "form_number": null
    },
    "page2_s3": {
      "section_id": "page2_s3",
      "section_title": null,
      "section_type": "prose",
      "raw_text": "NY Part C Affidavit by Producing Broker NY Notice of Excess Line Placement",
      "page_range": [
        2
      ],
      "form_number": null
    },
    "page3_s1": {
      "section_id": "page3_s1",
      "section_title": null,
      "section_type": "prose",
      "raw_text": "THIS QUOTE IS ISSUED BASED UPON THE INSURER'S AGREEMENT TO QUOTE AND IS ISSUED BY THE UNDERSIGNED WITHOUT ANY LIABILITY WHATSOEVER AS AN INSURER. THIS QUOTE MAYBE WITH-DRAWN BY THE INSURER AT ANY TIME PRIOR TO BINDING.",
      "page_range": [
        3
      ],
      "form_number": null
    },
    "page3_s2": {
      "section_id": "page3_s2",
      "section_title": null,
      "section_type": "prose",
      "raw_text": "QUOTE TO STAND FOR 30 DAYS, SUBJECT TO NO LOSS PRIOR TO FORM ORDER.",
      "page_range": [
        3
      ],
      "form_number": null
    },
    "page4_s1": {
      "section_id": "page4_s1",
      "section_title": "USA FLOOD MINIMUM EARNED PREMIUM ENDORSEMENT",
      "section_type": "prose",
      "raw_text": "The following terms and conditions will apply to this policy where the peril of Flood is included:",
      "page_range": [
        4
      ],
      "form_number": null
    },
    "page4_s2": {
      "section_id": "page4_s2",
      "section_title": null,
      "section_type": "prose",
      "raw_text": "1. Unless the Insured property is sold, if you cancel this policy, remove a location or reduce the amount of Insurance on a location that is within 75 miles of the Atlantic Ocean and/or the Gulf of Mexico in the states of North Carolina thru to Texas inclusive, and coverage existed any time during the period of June 1st to November 1st, the amount of premium we will return will be the Unearned Premium for the location. The Unearned Premium is the annual premium for the policy (or for the location removed or coverage reduced, as applicable) multiplied by the Unearned Factor noted below. The location premium is the 100% annual rate multiplied by the location value as scheduled in the most current Statement of Values on file with Underwriters.",
      "page_range": [
        4
      ],
      "form_number": null
    },
    "page4_s3": {
      "section_id": "page4_s3",
      "section_title": null,
      "section_type": "prose",
      "raw_text": "2. The provisions of this endorsement replace any short rate provisions stipulated in this policy for all locations that are within 75 miles of the Atlantic Ocean and/or the Gulf of Mexico in the states of North Carolina through to Texas inclusive, and coverage existed any time during the period of June 1st to November 1st.",
      "page_range": [
        4
      ],
      "form_number": null
    },
    "page4_s4": {
      "section_id": "page4_s4",
      "section_title": null,
      "section_type": "prose",
      "raw_text": "3. If the Insured property is sold, the Earned Premium shall be computed pro-rata, but a minimum of 25% of the premium as of Inception in respect of the sold property shall become earned.",
      "page_range": [
        4
      ],
      "form_number": null
    },
    "page4_s5": {
      "section_id": "page4_s5",
      "section_title": null,
      "section_type": "prose",
      "raw_text": "Failure of the Assured to make timely payment of premium shall be considered a request by the Assured for the Underwriters to cancel this Insurance. In the event of such cancellation by the Underwriters for non-payment of premium the Minimum Premium shall be due and payable; provided however, such non-payment cancellation shall be rescinded if the Assured remits the full premium within 10 days of the date of notice of cancellation.",
      "page_range": [
        4
      ],
      "form_number": null
    },
    "page4_s6": {
      "section_id": "page4_s6",
      "section_title": null,
      "section_type": "prose",
      "raw_text": "All other terms and conditions remain unchanged.",
      "page_range": [
        4
      ],
      "form_number": null
    }
  },
